          {
            "label": "One hour in the dark",
            "sections": [
              {
                "heading": "One hour in the dark",
                "accent": "amber",
                "text": [
                  "Warden's defining trait is that it does not go blind when the wifi does: up to one hour of classified events buffers to a reserved flash partition."
                ],
                "bullets": [
                  "The router reboots and Warden's association drops; the connection manager marks the wifi link and cloud session LOST and switches the recorder's output to the flash buffer.",
                  "Warden probes for the access point on a 5 s / 15 s / 60 s backoff while sensing and classification continue unaffected.",
                  "Motion fires and the recorder writes event `ev-4361` to flash segment 1 with its wall-clock timestamp and monotonic counter.",
                  "Two more events land in segments 2–3; the write head advances and the buffer reports 41 minutes of capacity left.",
                  "At 58 minutes offline the ring is full and the recorder overwrites the oldest unprotected segment — oldest events are lost first, newest are kept.",
                  "Skybridge misses three heartbeats and tells Vitals, which has Courier push an \"offline since 18:02\" alert to the household.",
                  "*Flash segments are counted 1–12 in this story (segment 1 = the buffer's first write); the buffer widget's cells below are 0-indexed internally, so segment 1 = cell 0, segment 2 = cell 1, and so on.*",
                  "**Wifi drops** — the whole point: classification and recording continue, events buffer to flash for ~60 minutes, oldest-first overwrite after that; a longer outage loses the oldest excess, never the most recent events.",
                  "**Power fails** — wired, no battery: the camera goes dark and the timeline shows a hard gap; the supercap only guarantees the in-flight flash write completes, so the buffer is never corrupted mid-segment.",
                  "**Flash wear** — buffer segments failing verification are retired, shrinking capacity; Vitals raises an advisory below 30 minutes."
                ],
                "diagram": {
                  "groups": {"warden": {"title": "Warden camera"}},
                  "nodes": {
                    "conn": {"title": "Conn manager", "sub": "wifi + tls", "icon": "antenna", "tint": "dev", "group": "warden"},
                    "rec": {"title": "Recorder", "sub": "classify + write", "icon": "gear", "tint": "dev", "group": "warden"},
                    "flash": {"title": "Flash buffer", "sub": "512 MB / 60 min", "icon": "db", "tint": "dev", "group": "warden"},
                    "ap": {"title": "Access point", "sub": "household wifi", "icon": "router", "tint": "dev"},
                    "skybridge": {"title": "Skybridge", "sub": "device gateway", "icon": "cloud", "tint": "cmd",
                      "link": "https://github.com/nestrel/cloud/blob/main/services/skybridge/session.go#L86"},
                    "vitals": {"title": "Vitals", "sub": "fleet health", "icon": "db", "tint": "data",
                      "link": "https://github.com/nestrel/cloud/blob/main/services/vitals/health.go#L94"},
                    "courier": {"title": "Courier", "sub": "notifications", "icon": "cloud", "tint": "cmd",
                      "link": "https://github.com/nestrel/cloud/blob/main/services/courier/push.go#L72"},
                    "phone": {"title": "Household", "sub": "nestrel app", "icon": "phone", "tint": "dev"}
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    [["conn", "rec", "flash"], "ap", "skybridge"],
                    ["vitals", "courier", "phone"]
                  ],
                  "edges": [
                    {"from": "conn", "to": "ap", "kind": "wifi", "label": "probe"},
                    {"from": "rec", "to": "flash", "kind": "int", "label": "evt"},
                    {"from": "skybridge", "to": "vitals", "kind": "int", "label": "3 beats missed"},
                    {"from": "vitals", "to": "courier", "kind": "int", "label": "cam offline"},
                    {"from": "courier", "to": "phone", "kind": "https", "label": "offline alert"}
                  ],
